{"path":"results/simple-ideas-8x8-p2-len3g2-comp0-7-bounties-from-5-scaling-ladder-20261024/summary.md","title":"Scaling: Medium graph (8 × 8, bounties from level 5)","html":"<h1>Scaling: Medium graph (8 × 8, bounties from level 5)</h1>\n<p><strong>Question:</strong> On a medium idea graph, how does what each society achieves grow with its budget (200 to 25600)?</p>\n<p><strong>Answer:</strong> At budget 200: best OSO (α = 0.2, β = 1). Against traditional, clearly better on hardest level, targets solved, knowledge found (bits), knowledge per unit of money and waste; no clear difference on bounty value and ROI. At budgets 400–800: best OSO (α = 0.2, β = 1). Against traditional, clearly better on hardest level, targets solved, bounty value, ROI, knowledge found (bits), knowledge per unit of money and waste. At budget 1600: best OSO (α = 0.8, β = 1). Against traditional, clearly better on hardest level, targets solved, bounty value, ROI, knowledge found (bits), knowledge per unit of money and waste. At budget 3200: best OSO (α = 0.2, β = 1). Against traditional, clearly better on hardest level, targets solved, bounty value, ROI, knowledge found (bits), knowledge per unit of money, money to the main level and waste. At budgets 6400–25600: best OSO (α = 0.8, β = 1). Against traditional, clearly better on ROI, knowledge per unit of money, money to the main level and waste; no clear difference on hardest level, targets solved, bounty value and knowledge found (bits). (Compared at each budget; 8 measures, a clear difference is more than 2.7 standard errors.)</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Budget 200: hardest level: 4.97 against traditional 0.00, clearly better. targets solved: 0.33 against traditional 0.00, clearly better.</li>\n<li>Budget 400: hardest level: 6.73 against traditional 0.20, clearly better. targets solved: 2.47 against traditional 0.03, clearly better.</li>\n<li>Budget 800: hardest level: 7.83 against traditional 0.40, clearly better. targets solved: 6.37 against traditional 0.13, clearly better.</li>\n<li>Budget 1600: hardest level: 8.00 against traditional 2.00, clearly better. targets solved: 8.00 against traditional 0.57, clearly better.</li>\n<li>Budget 3200: hardest level: 8.00 against traditional 6.80, clearly better. targets solved: 8.00 against traditional 4.43, clearly better.</li>\n<li>Budget 6400: hardest level: 8.00 against traditional 8.00, no clear difference. targets solved: 8.00 against traditional 7.97, no clear difference.</li>\n<li>Budget 12800: hardest level: 8.00 against traditional 8.00, no clear difference. targets solved: 8.00 against traditional 8.00, no clear difference.</li>\n<li>Budget 25600: hardest level: 8.00 against traditional 8.00, no clear difference. targets solved: 8.00 against traditional 8.00, no clear difference.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"files/results/simple-ideas-8x8-p2-len3g2-comp0-7-bounties-from-5-scaling-ladder-20261024/figures/compare.svg\" alt=\"Scaling: Medium graph (8 × 8, bounties from level 5)\"></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>society</th>\n<th>budget</th>\n<th>frontier</th>\n<th>targets solved</th>\n<th>value gained</th>\n<th>ROI (value per spend)</th>\n<th>knowledge (bits)</th>\n<th>bits per money</th>\n<th>cost</th>\n<th>waste</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Traditional (α = 1, β = 0)</td>\n<td>200</td>\n<td>0.0 ± 0.0</td>\n<td>0.0 ± 0.0</td>\n<td>0 ± 0</td>\n<td>0.00 ± 0.00</td>\n<td>20 ± 5</td>\n<td>0.102 ± 0.024</td>\n<td>–</td>\n<td>0.27 ± 0.09</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Traditional (α = 1, β = 0)</td>\n<td>400</td>\n<td>0.2 ± 1.1</td>\n<td>0.0 ± 0.2</td>\n<td>4 ± 23</td>\n<td>0.01 ± 0.06</td>\n<td>30 ± 5</td>\n<td>0.076 ± 0.014</td>\n<td>–</td>\n<td>0.42 ± 0.09</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Traditional (α = 1, β = 0)</td>\n<td>800</td>\n<td>0.4 ± 1.5</td>\n<td>0.1 ± 0.6</td>\n<td>17 ± 82</td>\n<td>0.02 ± 0.10</td>\n<td>42 ± 7</td>\n<td>0.053 ± 0.009</td>\n<td>–</td>\n<td>0.55 ± 0.06</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Traditional (α = 1, β = 0)</td>\n<td>1600</td>\n<td>2.0 ± 2.7</td>\n<td